  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Missile Fist — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned that a strong offense is the only thing that matters. As an action for 3 CE, you create a 30 ft cone of <em>Missile Fists</em>. All creatures within the cone must make a Strength saving throw. <br />\nOn a failed save, they take 2d8 necrotic damage for every attack you can make as an action and they are knocked prone. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and is not knocked prone. You can spend your bonus action to increase the damage by 2d8. You can spend cursed energy up to your CE modifier to increase damage by 2d8 per CE.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
